From: LM-G820N Developer <dev@lmg820n.invalid>
Subject: [PATCH] qcom: normalize final AWB RGB gains

Convert the adjusted white-point ratios to RGB gains with the factory
minimum-channel normalization used before PopulateOutput.

diff --git a/src/libcamera/pipeline/qcom/awb_output.h b/src/libcamera/pipeline/qcom/awb_output.h
--- a/src/libcamera/pipeline/qcom/awb_output.h
+++ b/src/libcamera/pipeline/qcom/awb_output.h
@@ -9,0 +10,7 @@
+
+inline std::array<float, 3> qtiAwbRgbGains(QtiAwbPoint point)
+{
+	float scale = std::fmax(point.rg, 1.0f);
+	scale = point.bg > scale ? point.bg : scale;
+	return { scale / point.rg, scale, scale / point.bg };
+}
